From: isp <40058476+isprogrammer@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: yiming-uz801v3: enable call audio

Include the shared MSM8916 Q6Voice sound card overlay used by UFI003 and
MIFIB-V12. It routes QDSP6 voice over APR and the internal BT SCO link, with
no board-specific codec pin assignments.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-yiming-uz801v3.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-yiming-uz801v3.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-yiming-uz801v3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-yiming-uz801v3.dts
@@ -5,0 +6 @@
+#include "msm8916-ufi-voice.dtsi"
